WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.593
The three-card tarot spread is a flexible layout that
can tell a story over time or frame a choice.

00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:09.466
Here are two ways to read it.

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:13.269
The classic frame: past, present, next.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:16.222
The most familiar version reads left to
right.

00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:20.843
Card 1 is the past, card 2 is the present
and card 3 is what comes next.

00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:24.934
A second frame: situation, action,
outcome.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:28.180
The same three places can ask different
questions.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.942
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:36.732
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
